    "world_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "序章 星星图书馆",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "在很久很久以前，在每个人来到世界以前，我们都曾在云端住过一小会儿。那时，我们是小天使。",
      "next": "world_002"
    },
    "world_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "小天使们睡在云朵做的小摇篮里。月光从翅膀边经过，像一封还没有拆开的信。",
      "next": "world_003"
    },
    "world_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "等到出发日来到，他们会去星星图书馆。那里没有屋顶，因为星星太多，屋顶会装不下。",
      "next": "world_003_extra_01"
    },
    "cloud_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "confused",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "今天……是不是轮到我了？",
      "next": "cloud_002"
    },
    "cloud_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "是的。今天，云朵要把你送到出发的地方。",
      "next": "cloud_003"
    },
    "cloud_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "worried",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "出发以后，我会落到哪里呢？",
      "next": "cloud_004"
    },
    "cloud_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "explain",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "去人间。去一个以后会叫作家的地方。家不是最漂亮的房子；家是你哭的时候，有人把手伸出来；也是你走远以后，还有一盏灯记得你。",
      "next": "cloud_005"
    },
    "cloud_005": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "confused",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "那我要怎么认出它？如果我看错了呢？",
      "next": "cloud_006"
    },
    "cloud_006": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "真正属于你的家，不会只站在眼睛前面。它会轻轻碰一下你的心，你要安静一点，才能听见。",
      "next": "archive_001"
    },
    "archive_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-starmap.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "云阶的尽头，是一座没有屋顶的图书馆。星星像一本本小书，排在空中；每一本里，都藏着一个家的故事。",
      "next": "archive_002"
    },
    "archive_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-starmap.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "explain",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "你不能只看一眼就决定。重要的事，常常要多看一会儿。",
      "next": "archive_002_page_02"
    },
    "archive_002_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-starmap.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "explain",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "每靠近一颗新的星星，都要带上一点星尘。星尘可以从观察里收集；不够的时候，也可以去玩一个小小的游戏。",
      "next": "archive_003"
    },
    "archive_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-starmap.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "normal",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "你能告诉我，哪一个家最好吗？",
      "next": "archive_004"
    },
    "archive_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-starmap.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "不能。你不是来寻找最好的家。你是在寻找那一个会认出你的家。",
      "next": "archive_reward"
    },
    "archive_reward": {
