        "expression": "confused",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "这个家……是不是有一点点大声？刚才那是门铃，还是谁不小心踩到了地球？",
      "next": "dino_003"
    },
    "dino_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "explain",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "这是恐龙之家。如果小天使选择这里，出生以后不一定先哭，也可能先很有礼貌地“嗷呜”一声。",
      "next": "dino_004"
    },
    "dino_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "confused",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "那我会变成恐龙吗？圆脸小恐龙可以穿小裙子吗？如果尾巴太长，坐小板凳会不会有一点尴尬？",
      "next": "dino_005"
    },
    "dino_005": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "恐龙之家里，一个恐龙爸爸正在给小恐龙系围兜。",
      "next": "dino_005_page_02"
    },
    "dino_005_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "围兜很漂亮，恐龙也很努力。可是围兜刚系好，小恐龙一低头，整张餐桌就悄悄往前挪了半厘米。",
      "next": "dino_006"
    },
    "dino_006": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "这里的爱很直接。饿了，就给一大盆青菜；开心了，就把尾巴摇成扫帚；难过了，就用很大的脑袋轻轻蹭一蹭。",
      "next": "dino_006_page_02"
    },
    "dino_006_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "小小的缺点是：他们以为很轻的一蹭，也可能把枕头蹭到隔壁房间。",
      "next": "dino_007"
    },
    "dino_007": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "听起来好热闹。可是如果我生气跺脚，大家会不会以为发生了一场很小的地震？",
      "next": "dino_home_preview"
    },
    "dino_home_preview": {
      "type": "minigame",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "game": "dino_eggs",
      "successNext": "dino_008"
    },
    "dino_008": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "touched",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "这些小恐龙真可爱。它们连躲回蛋里的样子都很认真，好像在说：请尊重我的蛋壳隐私。",
      "next": "dino_009"
    },
    "dino_009": {
      "type": "choice",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "serious",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "恐龙之家很好玩。可是如果我真的出生在这里，也许每天都要先学会：不要用尾巴扫掉杯子。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "变成小恐龙听起来也不错。",
          "set": {
            "dino_fun": 1,
            "dino_done": 1
          },
          "next": "dino_gift"
        },
        {
          "text": "我还是想当可以被抱在怀里的小女孩。",
          "set": {
            "human_wish": 1,
            "dino_done": 1
          },
          "next": "dino_gift"
        }
      ]
    },
    "dino_gift": {
      "type": "gacha",
      "background": "bg-dino.svg",
      "pool": "family_pool",
      "next": "home_map"
    },
    "warm_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "这颗星星的光有一点模糊，像隔着一层很轻的雾。里面的东西不急着说清楚。",
      "next": "warm_001_extra_01"
    },
    "warm_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "confused",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "这里……好普通。可是我靠近的时候，心里忽然安静了。好像有人把世界的声音放轻，只留下两张照片，等我看清。",
      "next": "warm_003"
    },
    "warm_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "explain",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "那就仔细看。真正的提示，常常不站在最亮的地方。",
      "next": "warm_003_page_02"
    },
    "warm_003_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "explain",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "有些星星不会一下子说出答案。它们会先让你看见：他们还没有成为大人以前，是什么样子。",
      "next": "warm_003b"
    },
    "warm_003b": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "左边的相框里，是爸爸小时候的照片。那时他还不是爸爸，只是一个小男孩，可能有点害羞，也可能正在努力装得很勇敢。",
      "next": "warm_003b_extra_01"
    },
    "warm_003b2": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "右边的相框里，是妈妈小时候的照片。那时她也还不是妈妈，只是一个小女孩，眼睛亮亮的，像刚刚发现了一件好玩的事。",
      "next": "warm_003c"
    },
    "warm_003c": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "confused",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "他们小时候也是小朋友呀？为什么我还没有见过他们，却觉得这两张照片有一点熟悉？",
      "next": "warm_003d"
    },
    "warm_003d": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "因为这就是普通之家给你的提示。长大以后的他们，会成为等你的人；",
      "next": "warm_003d_page_02"
    },
    "warm_003d_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "可是很久以前，他们也会摔跤，会撒娇，会因为一点小事开心很久。",
      "next": "warm_003d_extra_01"
    },
    "warm_003d2": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "guardian",
        "expression": "smile",
        "position": "right"
      },
      "text": "看见他们小时候的样子，你就知道：他们不是一出生就会当爸爸妈妈。他们也是带着自己的童年，一点点走来等你的。",
      "next": "warm_003e"
    },
    "warm_003e": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "两张照片一左一右，被小灯照得很柔和。照片里的他们都还那么小，却像已经从很远的童年出发，慢慢走到同一束灯光下。",
      "next": "warm_003e_page_02"
    },
    "warm_003e_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "那束光没有说话，只安静地把中间的位置留出来，像在等一个还没有出生的孩子靠近。",
      "next": "warm_004"
    },
    "warm_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "touched",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "左边是爸爸小时候，右边是妈妈小时候。中间那一小片空白，被灯光轻轻留着。",
      "next": "warm_004_page_02"
    },
    "warm_004_page_02": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "touched",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "原来他们还没有见过我。可是他们的小时候、现在和以后，好像已经慢慢排成了一条路。",
      "next": "warm_005"
    },
    "warm_005": {
      "type": "choice",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "photoScene": "warm_family_photos",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": {
        "character": "little_angel",
        "expression": "worried",
        "position": "left"
      },
      "text": "普通之家没有最亮的房子，也没有最多的礼物。可是我看见那两张照片时，忽然觉得：如果我去了那里，也许会被两个曾经也是小孩的人，好好抱住。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "我想再看看那两张照片。",
          "set": {
            "belonging": 1,
            "warm_done": 1
          },
          "next": "warm_gift"
        },
        {
          "text": "我想靠近这个普通的家。",
          "set": {
            "belonging": 2,
            "warm_done": 1
          },
          "next": "warm_gift"
        }
      ]
    },
    "warm_gift": {
      "type": "gacha",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "pool": "warm_pool",
      "next": "home_map"
    },
